   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Trying to deploy to shinyapps. One app is working: <a href=\"https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363994430000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2utI4fJFxRCw96PJ8_K2fv\">https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/</a> although it cannot find the aceEditor function from the shinyAce package installed from Github.<div><br></div><div>For two others app that use the same structure, and run fine locally I get:</div><div><br></div><div>Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 4630921 error: Unhandled Exception: &#39;NoneType&#39; object has no attribute &#39;__getitem__&#39;<br></div><div><br></div><div>Any ideas?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ElkwVSV-grgJ",
   "from": "Shea Parkes",
