   "subject": "Re: Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 4630921 error: Unhandled Exception: 'NoneType' object has no attribute '__getitem__'",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I too am getting this same error.  I found this older post that looks like this bug was found and squashed once upon a time:<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/shinyapps-users/T0VEoSTrTAU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/shinyapps-users/T0VEoSTrTAU&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363994430000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16HaHtYKybtSuGKGi_ahrz\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/shinyapps-users/T0VEoSTrTAU</a></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m happy to share the whole app I was trying to send up.  It was small and worked fine locally.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Tuesday, January 27, 2015 at 7:02:11 PM UTC-5, Vincent Nijs wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Trying to deploy to shinyapps. One app is working: <a href=\"https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363994431000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0HzZyLl8eE2noqX9-8_hsh\">https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/</a> although it cannot find the aceEditor function from the shinyAce package installed from Github.<div><br></div><div>For two others app that use the same structure, and run fine locally I get:</div><div><br></div><div>Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 4630921 error: Unhandled Exception: &#39;NoneType&#39; object has no attribute &#39;__getitem__&#39;<br></div><div><br></div><div>Any ideas?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
