     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Wednesday, January 28, 2015 at 12:35:56 PM UTC-5, Andy Kipp wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Folks,</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for reporting this. I think we addressed the issue this morning, so you should now be able to deploy your application.</div><div><br></div><div>Sorry for the inconvenience.</div><div> </div><div>Thanks</div><div>-Andy</div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Jan 28, 2015 at 4:37 AM, Andrew Caines <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">cain...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Both, me too!<div><br></div><div>Some reproducible code (from an <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/26613181/r-shiny-app-using-ggvis-gives-error-during-upload\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/26613181/r-shiny-app-using-ggvis-gives-error-during-upload&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363994444000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MEDcAARlDH302WAyG1vbf\">older SO post</a>, slightly edited with fixes):</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#800\">## ui.R</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bootstrapPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ggvisOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ggvis&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ggvis_ui&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## server.R</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  input_width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  mtcars </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mpg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    layer_histograms</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input_width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    bind_shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ggvis&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ggvis_ui&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## When located in folder with ui.R and server.R file:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;shiny&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;shinyapps&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>runApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># works fine locally</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>deployApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># error message</span></code></pre></div></code></div><br><br></div><div>With deployApp(), I see the same error message as in the subject line of the previous posts. It is the next console message after ## End Log ##, (i.e. after installing packages and copying files). This happens both with the above reproducible example and my own Shiny App code.</div><div><br></div><div>Andrew</div><div><div><div><br></div><div><br><br>On Wednesday, 28 January 2015 02:49:06 UTC, Shea Parkes  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I too am getting this same error.  I found this older post that looks like this bug was found and squashed once upon a time:<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/shinyapps-users/T0VEoSTrTAU\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/shinyapps-users/T0VEoSTrTAU&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363994444000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wuv9lEmDw8uZlZcIfjY7k\">https://groups.google.com/<u></u>forum/#!topic/shinyapps-users/<u></u>T0VEoSTrTAU</a></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m happy to share the whole app I was trying to send up.  It was small and worked fine locally.</div><div><br>On Tuesday, January 27, 2015 at 7:02:11 PM UTC-5, Vincent Nijs wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Trying to deploy to shinyapps. One app is working: <a href=\"https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mostly-harmless.shinyapps.io/base/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363994444000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23spfKhJGQ_be1WZjXIB4E\">https://mostly-<u></u>harmless.shinyapps.io/base/</a> although it cannot find the aceEditor function from the shinyAce package installed from Github.<div><br></div><div>For two others app that use the same structure, and run fine locally I get:</div><div><br></div><div>Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 4630921 error: Unhandled Exception: &#39;NoneType&#39; object has no attribute &#39;__getitem__&#39;<br></div><div><br></div><div>Any ideas?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received t